            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>Subsection 78(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>warehouse</i></b><b><i> licence application charge</i></b> means the warehouse licence application charge imposed by the <i>Customs Licensing Charges Act 1997</i> and payable as set out in <ref href="#sec-80">section 80</ref>.</p>
                  <p><b><i>warehouse</i></b><b><i> licence charge</i></b> means the warehouse licence charge imposed by the <i>Customs Licensing Charges Act 1997</i> and payable as set out in <ref href="#sec-85">section 85</ref>.</p>
                  <p><b><i>warehouse</i></b><b><i> licence variation charge</i></b> means the warehouse licence variation charge imposed by the <i>Customs Licensing Charges Act 1997</i> and payable as set out in <ref href="#sec-81B">section 81B</ref> of this Act.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-10">
              <num>10</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 80</heading>
